#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Is Biosafety Land?"
msgstr "An Talamh Bithshábháilteachta é?"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Indicates whether this is a Biosafety Land instance."
msgstr "Léiríonn sé an cás Bithshábháilteachta é seo."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Field Behavior Settings"
msgstr "Socruithe Iompraíochta Réimse"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Field Visibility Control"
msgstr "Cumasaigh Rialú Infheictheachta Réimse"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Show/hide fields based on content type selection. Controls URL, date, and published fields visibility."
msgstr "Taispeáin/folaigh réimsí bunaithe ar roghnú an chineáil ábhair. Rialaíonn sé infheictheacht réimsí URL, dáta, agus foilsithe."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Additional Fields"
msgstr "Cumasaigh Réimsí Breise"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Add content-type specific additional fields (event statuses, project statuses, etc.) based on thesaurus content type."
msgstr "Cuir réimsí breise a bhaineann go sonrach le cineál ábhair (stádais imeachtaí, stádais tionscadail, etc.) bunaithe ar chineál ábhair an teasárais."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Auto Summary"
msgstr "Cumasaigh Achoimre Uathoibríoch"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Automatically generate summary from body content as user types."
msgstr "Gineann sé achoimre go huathoibríoch ó ábhar an choirp de réir mar a chlóscríobhann an t-úsáideoir."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Field Help Comments"
msgstr "Cumasaigh Tráchtanna Cabhrach Réimse"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Display contextual help comments for fields based on content type."
msgstr "Taispeáin tráchtanna cabhrach comhthéacsúla do réimsí bunaithe ar chineál an ábhair."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Field Visibility Rules"
msgstr "Rialacha Infheictheachta Réimse"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Define custom field visibility rules (JSON format)."
msgstr "Sainmhínigh rialacha infheictheachta réimse saincheaptha (formáid JSON)."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Translation Defaults"
msgstr "Réamhshocruithe Aistriúcháin"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Configure creation of translation defaults (language placeholders) for translatable entities."
msgstr "Cumraigh cruthú réamhshocruithe aistriúcháin (sealbhóirí teanga) d'eintitis in-aistrithe."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Automatically create translation defaults"
msgstr "Cruthaigh réamhshocruithe aistriúcháin go huathoibríoch"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translation defaults (placeholders) are created for other languages at entity create/update. Existing translations with proper source are not overwritten."
msgstr "Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, cruthaítear réamhshocruithe aistriúcháin (sealbhóirí) do theangacha eile nuair a chruthaítear/nuashonraítear eintiteas. Ní fhorscríobhtar aistriúcháin atá ann cheana le foinse cheart."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Use all available languages"
msgstr "Úsáid gach teanga atá ar fáil"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translations will be created for all languages installed on the site. When disabled, only the selected target languages below will be used."
msgstr "Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, cruthófar aistriúcháin do gach teanga atá suiteáilte ar an suíomh. Nuair atá sé díchumasaithe, ní úsáidfear ach na sprioctheangacha roghnaithe thíos."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Target languages for translation defaults"
msgstr "Sprioctheangacha do réamhshocruithe aistriúcháin"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select which languages to create translation defaults for. Used only when \"Use all available languages\" is disabled."
msgstr "Roghnaigh cé na teangacha chun réamhshocruithe aistriúcháin a chruthú dóibh. Ní úsáidtear é ach amháin nuair atá \"Úsáid gach teanga atá ar fáil\" díchumasaithe."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Copy source field values"
msgstr "Cóipeáil luachanna réimse foinse"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translatable field values from the source language will be copied to new translations."
msgstr "Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, cóipeálfar luachanna réimse in-aistrithe ón teanga foinse chuig aistriúcháin nua."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Entity types"
msgstr "Cineálacha eintitis"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select which entity types should have translation defaults created."
msgstr "Roghnaigh cé na cineálacha eintitis ar cheart réamhshocruithe aistriúcháin a chruthú dóibh."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Batch Operations"
msgstr "Oibríochtaí Baisce"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Process existing entities to create missing translation defaults."
msgstr "Próiseáil eintitis atá ann cheana chun réamhshocruithe aistriúcháin atá in easnamh a chruthú."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Entity type to process"
msgstr "Cineál eintitis le próiseáil"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "- Select -"
msgstr "- Roghnaigh -"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select an entity type to create translations for existing entities."
msgstr "Roghnaigh cineál eintitis chun aistriúcháin a chruthú d'eintitis atá ann cheana."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Create translation defaults for existing entities"
msgstr "Cruthaigh réamhshocruithe aistriúcháin d'eintitis atá ann cheana"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Please select an entity type to process."
msgstr "Roghnaigh cineál eintitis le próiseáil, le do thoil."

